      "feature": "developer-api-request-logs (0104 / ADR-054) \u2014 schema=developer",
      "$note": "The Console's API Logs screen. Written by api-gateway at developer-key authentication, read by developer-api scoped to one project. Column granularity because the columns ARE the privacy boundary: this table has no header, body or credential column and no JSONB, so an added one is drift worth failing on.",
